{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a901d1dd-48f5-8c15-b205-8b689b00fc95",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T09:13:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diogo Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, sorry to bother you. I know this is silly, but I have a question about a Christmas tree. It's March, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's not silly. We get a few every year. What's going on with the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, [crosstalk] hold on one second, there's some noise here, the television is on and my neighbor's here visiting. Let me go shut the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry about that. Is that better? I'm on the speakerphone, I can never work the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better, I can hear you fine now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So, sorry, the tree. It's out by the side of the house still, dried out completely, and I never got it to the curb in January. Is there still a pickup for it, or did I miss the boat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The special tree collection is usually just in January, so that window's closed. But you've got options. Is it a real tree, not artificial?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Real, yes. Sorry, it's a little Fraser fir, about six feet. I could cut it up if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That does help. Cut into pieces, it can generally go out with your yard waste, or you can bring it to the drop-off site. I'd say check the yard waste schedule for your street, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. And, sorry, I know it's a silly thing to ask, is there a fee for that? I don't want to get in trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're not in trouble at all. For regular curbside pickup there's no extra charge. If you take it to the drop-off site, they'd tell you there if anything applies. I don't want to say wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Sorry, one more thing. Should I wait for the rain to stop? It's coming down awful today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd wait. Nobody wants to be sawing a tree in this. Set it out when it's dry, and bundle the pieces so they don't blow around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. Sorry, do you need my address for anything? It's 371 Kingston Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 371 Kingston. Your pickup day follows your zone, so I'll note that you asked. If you call back Monday I can read you the schedule, or it's on the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's lovely. Sorry for taking your time, you've been very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all, Mr. Correia. Stay dry out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T09:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, dear. Thank you, bye now."
    }
  ],
